  <text>
    <body>
      <p>James C. Steel, hide merchant, is listed at 34 <ref target="civic?id=Leicester%20Street">Leicester Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1864 to 1880. From 1873 he is listed as a hide merchant and tanner, and in 1879 and 1880 at Nos 34 and 36.</p>
